<title>NIGERIA: United Nigerian Textiles 96 profits rise.</title>
<headline>United Nigerian Textiles 96 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year results for United Nigerian Textiles to end-December 1996, published on Monday. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				    1996	1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		    10,200 vs 9,800</p>
<p>    Profit before taxation   1,000 vs 821</p>
<p>    Taxation			 337 vs 393</p>
<p>    Profit after taxation	673 vs 428</p>
<p>    Dividend			  35 kobo vs 25 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE: The company is also proposing a scrip of one new share for five.</p>
<p>($1=83.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
